      "writtenOn": "2023-01-12T08:15:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In that case, is there any way we can include some information that\u0027s likely to help debugging ? E.g. the first 50 bytes and last 50 bytes before the underflow ? Would that be likely to help ?",
