      "writtenOn": "2023-01-12T15:49:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The error may happen in random place. I am afraid that first 50 bytes and last 50 bytes may not be able to know how to parse the message. E.g. The byte array is composed by `int+int+byte+int ..` or `byte + byte + byte + ...`. \n\nI updated to dump the information before the exception position. I think this would help though it may still possibly dump almost all the message.",
